##Leafos
accessibility.leafos_intro=Oh, hello. I was hoping somemone would come and help me tidy up this mess. You must be the new owner! I'm Leafos, and I'm here to help you.
accessibility.leafos_give_journal=This is the Journal. Tap on anything new you discover for more information.
accessibility.leafos_Garden_intro=See that sign in the center of the garden? Click it to give your garden a name. (It can be changed later)
accessibility.leafos_shovel_intro=Time for another present. Something you can't manage without.
accessibility.leafos_give_shovel=O.K. Grab your shovel and turn this mess into your dream garden!

accessibility.leafos_0=If you want an Elephanilla, don't have any Mousemallows as they will frighten the Elephanilla.
accessibility.leafos_1=Have you heard that Weedlings have breath so bad that it can wilt flowers?
accessibility.leafos_2=I heard from a Watchling that sour Macaraccoons calm down if you feed them loads of Whirlm eggs.
accessibility.leafos_3=I heard you can turn a Pretztail into a Mallowolf if it eats a Doenut
accessibility.leafos_4=Lottie says that Ivor only sells badly made junk.
accessibility.leafos_5=Mothdrops eat wool and turn it into mothballs.
accessibility.leafos_6=Roarios are like pinata royalty, so maybe you need a Queen Buzzlegum or Queen Raisant to tempt them into the garden?
accessibility.leafos_7=There's an old wives tale about a magic accessory that stops a pinata from getting old
accessibility.leafos_8=The secret of the Pigxie is to feed a Rashberry 10 Tafflys. Shhh, don't tell anyone else.
accessibility.leafos_9=This is a really secret tip, feed a Rashberry with 10 pumpkins and it'll grow into a Chippopatamus. Don't tell anyone else.
accessibility.leafos_10=This is a secret, so don't tell. If you become a Dragumfly Master Romancer, a Dragonache appears in the garden.
accessibility.leafos_11=Watch a Jameleon when it's hunting. It can turn invisible!
accessibility.leafos_12=When a Cluckles eats five different colored flowers it becomes a Parrybo!
accessibility.leafos_13=You should try this, get a Badgesicle to swim in water and it'll turn into a Sweetooth.
accessibility.leafos_14=Feeding a Dragumfly to a Pudgeon evolves it into a Buzzenge.
accessibility.leafos_15=Goobaas will not romance without their fleece. I think they get shy.
accessibility.leafos_16=I was told that Fizzlybears are fussy, they only like royalty. But I'm not sure what that means.

accessibility.leafos_17=Apparently Rashberries have weak gums, so they like to eat mushy, rotten food.
accessibility.leafos_18=Arocknids eat Tafflys but when Tafflys cousin Reddhott is in town you might just see some toasted Arocknid.
accessibility.leafos_19=A Sour Bonboon won't calm down until it's been shamed by a snake piñata.
accessibility.leafos_20=Bart said he could cure 'two in one' or something. We were talking about toadstools and Profitamoles at the time.
accessibility.leafos_21=Dastardos is so single minded. What we need to do is find a way to distract him so Patch can get here in time.
accessibility.leafos_22=Did you know Fudgehogs like Poison Ivy? Or was that Thistles? I can't really remember.
accessibility.leafos_23=Diggerlings have very sensitive eyes. They like it underground where it's less bright.
accessibility.leafos_24=Don't you think that the white flutterscotch is a bit drab? I remember there used to be lots of different colored Flutterscotches.
accessibility.leafos_25=Do you know what? I'd love to see what happened if the Sour Crowla got sick and you called the doctor.
accessibility.leafos_26=Have you heard of the Tower of Sour? That's what you need to stop sours coming to mess up your garden.
accessibility.leafos_27=Have you met Gretchen, yet? She told me that Sour Sherbats eat pumpkins.
accessibility.leafos_28=Have you tried feeding baby pinatas with milk? Babies like milk don't they?
accessibility.leafos_29=I don't know what Arfur Stout puts in his cookies, but helpers can't resist going into his shop.
accessibility.leafos_30=I don't know what's worse, putting up with Ruffian behavior or paying them to go away.
accessibility.leafos_31=If you can afford a Cluckles, you should get one. They're supposed to be good for eggs.	
accessibility.leafos_32=I heard a rumor that cocoadile tears are the best way to grow perfect plants.
accessibility.leafos_33=I heard that the Salamango is changed from another type of pinata.
accessibility.leafos_34=I'm sure I saw a Sparrowmint swallow a small bit of yellow litter that was floating in the breeze once and it turned it into something yellow itself.
accessibility.leafos_35=I'm sure people would like Seedos more if he gave away more seeds. You should try to knock some sense into him.
accessibility.leafos_36=I often wonder what happened to my long lost brother Stardos. Sigh...
accessibility.leafos_37=I think that Barkbarks actually enjoy fighting with Kittyflosses!
accessibility.leafos_38=It might not be very nice when Professor Pester arrives in the garden, but it does mean your garden is very valuable.
accessibility.leafos_39=I told Petula that I'd seen a two headed Syrupent and she said she'd seen one with four heads. She just has to go one better!
accessibility.leafos_40=I've been looking for a console and a game to keep my dad occupied during the day. If only there was a game about piñatas. Sigh...
accessibility.leafos_41=I've got two brothers and a sister you know. I was always the brains of the family.
accessibility.leafos_42=I've heard a rumor that you can tame a Sour Mallowolf. Yeah, when Rashberries fly.
accessibility.leafos_43=I've heard that some Lickatoads are immune to poison.
accessibility.leafos_44=Ivor had a run of bad luck at the Pinata races. But I'd trust him with my money, if I had any.
accessibility.leafos_45=I was told that no one can resist a Cinnamonkey in a hat, including other Cinnamonkeys.
accessibility.leafos_46=Look for gaps between loathers in the Romance mazes. You can often find shortcuts.	
accessibility.leafos_47=Lottie doesn't want you to know this, but you can make your own fertilizer. One of the bug pinatas can help.
accessibility.leafos_48=Lottie seems to charge a lot for milk. Willy asks why don't you make your own? All you need is a cow and his help.	
accessibility.leafos_49=My brother Seedos told me that Shellybeans love seeds but he thinks everything should love seeds.
accessibility.leafos_50=My dad, Jardiniero, has been saying nice things about you. Don't tell him I told you though.
accessibility.leafos_51=My dad was such a good gardener, because he enjoyed working here. If you aren't enjoying your garden, change it into something else. Something that you really like.	
accessibility.leafos_52=On really rare occasions, special pinatas are born. They look different than normal and are a sign of good luck.
accessibility.leafos_53=Pinata Central will send you sweets when you give them the pinata they have asked for.
accessibility.leafos_54=Pinatas that get sent to parties come back more valuable than when they left.
accessibility.leafos_55=Ponockies are jealous of big, tall Horstachios, and they'll try to take them down a peg or two if possible.
accessibility.leafos_56=Seedos is my brother. He wasn't always called that you know.
accessibility.leafos_57=Storkos is like a Buzzlegum, because technically she shouldn't be able to fly.	
accessibility.leafos_58=Some people don't like Syrupents, just because they like Mousemallow candy.
accessibility.leafos_59=Sometimes Bart can change something he's already changed into another new thing. Do you understand?
accessibility.leafos_60=There's something familar about Dastardos, but I cannot put my finger on it.
accessibility.leafos_61=The other day I saw a Syrupent with two heads, honest.
accessibility.leafos_62=The problem with Diggerlings is they make so much mess. If only there were a pinata that would eat piles of earth.
accessibility.leafos_63=The Reddhott looks like it's on fire! How can something so hot look so cool?
accessibility.leafos_64=When I look at the pinatas, I can almost hear them talking. I bet you could make a show about some pinatas having adventures.
accessibility.leafos_65=When Pinata Central sends a request, you should try to help them - it's really rewarding.
accessibility.leafos_66=You know Buzzlegums like honey. Well, so do Raisants, which is why they don't get on.
accessibility.leafos_67=Zumbugs think they're the best things on four legs. I bet it would upset them if a Chewnicorn showed up.

accessibility.leafos_68=Before you came to the island, people used to call squazzils by another name...Nonsquirrellel. But it sounds like 'not a squirrel' which is rubbish, so it was changed
accessibility.leafos_69=Don't listen to Petula - she's always making stuff up and gossiping. How could anyone like her?	
accessibility.leafos_70=Fannie might seem sweet and innocent, but I heard that she steams open love letters and copies them into the romance novel she's writing.	
accessibility.leafos_71=Have you noticed a funny smell when Seedos is in the garden?	
accessibility.leafos_72=If I'd been a boy when I was born, Dad was going to call me Justin, Our names are all so weird. They're the kind of names that you see in a computer game or a cartoon or something.	
accessibility.leafos_73=I find it a mystery how a Sprinkling can carry so much water.	
accessibility.leafos_74=I heard that Willy the Builder is so clucklepecked by his wife Lottie that he sits in the shed so she can watch exactly what she wants on TV.	
accessibility.leafos_75=I think Bart has a soft spot for Fannie. I might tell her to see what she thinks. Hee hee.	
accessibility.leafos_76=I've never met such calm, relaxed people as the Gatherlings. They seem to take it all in stride.	
accessibility.leafos_77=Mum always told me that if I didn't control my temper, I'd become a Ruffian. What a horrible thing to say to a child.	
accessibility.leafos_78=My sister Storkos thinks she's some kind of superhero. But she isn't really.	
accessibility.leafos_79=One of the best games I ever played was "Grabbed by the Ghoulies"
accessibility.leafos_80=Piñata Island is amazing! There's a swamp just over there and just around the corner there's a desert. I've never heard of any place like it.	
accessibility.leafos_81=Seedos runs much faster since you started to get seeds from him. You're keeping him fit!	
accessibility.leafos_82=Sometimes when he thinks I'm asleep Dad looks at the photos of the garden when it was his.	
accessibility.leafos_83=Storkos has had to give up eating eggs for breakfast in-case she nibbles a delivery.	
accessibility.leafos_84=Sometimes pinatas can lose some parts when they go to a party. Don't worry, they get patched up at Pinata Central before they come home.	

accessibility.leafos_85=I don't know why Seedos wants to live in the swamp, it's always damp and gloomy.
accessibility.leafos_86=I don't like to talk about people, but I think Dastardos is some kind of friend of Professor Pester.
accessibility.leafos_87=I think a Galagoogoo would appreciate some sunglasses to protect those big eyes.	
accessibility.leafos_88=I've got a friend at the town hall who says Pester changed his name to 'Professor'. He's never ever been to school.
accessibility.leafos_89=I wouldn't bother buying wire fence it's cheap, flimsy and it doesn't look very nice.
accessibility.leafos_90=Some plants grow bigger if you put the seeds in a hole.

